            "title": "Maza & Milestones",
            "heading_size": 7,
            "text": "<p>August has been full of progress at Simran Design Ltd - from our Maza restaurant’s installation in Cambridge to workplace designs in Wolverhampton, supplier visits and team celebrations.</p>",
