    "section_rich_text_7Lb9dX": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_yJ7qgd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>1. <strong>Maza Restaurant - Installation Phase</strong></h4><p></p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 20
          }
        },
        "text_VQhBG3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our design for <strong>Maza Restaurant in Cambridge</strong> is well into its installation stage, with launch planned for September. This month saw a flurry of site visits as our vision began to take shape:</p><ul><li>Swing seat fabrications tested on site - a playful and bespoke touch for the restaurant.</li><li>Unpacking 15 new pendant lights to confirm positioning.</li><li>Bespoke rattan, walnut and brass partitions arrive to zone the restaurant</li><li>Bar fabrication progressing, with the structure in place, ready for worktops and bespoke back bar shelving.</li><li>Meeting with Stylo Graphics to review signage templates, electrics, and wall tiling preparations.</li><li>Curated cushions, materials, and accessories are arriving to elevate the final space.</li></ul><p>It’s always rewarding to see months of design and planning come alive on site.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_yJ7qgd",
        "text_VQhBG3"
      ],
      "name": "Rich text",
      "settings": {
        "width": "wrapper",
        "align_text": "text-left",
        "bg_color": "",
        "color": "",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 20
      }
    },
    "section_columns_EWijPU": {
      "type": "section-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "image_jnyhFN": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2025-08-16_at_18.03.17.png",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "Swing seats onsite",
            "heading_size": 3,
            "text": "<p>We've designed bespoke swings for Maza's window seats, with powder-coated brass chains, Crib-5 'moss' leather fabric upholstery. We worked with our fit-out contractors to ensure the swing seats fit the brief as well as being commercially suitable, and we're loving this fun addition to the space!</p>",
            "text_size": 2,
            "button_text": "",
            "button_url": "",
            "button_type": "btn--primary",
            "button_size": "",
            "button_style": "btn--solid",
            "show_arrow": false
          }
        },
        "image_Mi3wpz": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2025-08-16_at_18.01.55.png",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "Lighting Goodness",
            "heading_size": 3,
            "text": "<p>This week we unpacked 15 pendant lights ready for installation, from these gorgeous Pooky Lighting natural shades, to olive and gold glass pendants from Lighting Direct, and rich vintage-inspired 'Desert' pendants from Rocket St George. We can't wait to see these lights dress the tall ceilings at Maza.</p>",
            "text_size": 2,
            "button_text": "",
            "button_url": "",
            "button_type": "btn--primary",
            "button_size": "",
            "button_style": "btn--solid",
            "show_arrow": false
          }
        },
        "image_GLfqQ4": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2025-08-16_at_18.04.19.png",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "Bespoke rattan partitions",
            "heading_size": 3,
            "text": "<p>We designed these beautiful rattan, walnut and brass partitions to zone the restaurant, from the first point of entry to the backs of booth seats, to create a sense of cosiness. The timeless natural rattan texture and colour flows throughout the restaurant, echoing Maza's traditional Pakistani roots. </p>",
            "text_size": 2,
            "button_text": "",
            "button_url": "",
            "button_type": "btn--primary",
            "button_size": "",
            "button_style": "btn--solid",
            "show_arrow": false
          }
        },
        "image_RJpeGX": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2025-08-16_at_18.20.58.png",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "Bar Fabrication Progress",
            "heading_size": 3,
            "text": "<p>The bar fabrication framework is in place, and this week we saw the worktop, back bar shelving, hatch door and internal shelves installation. This bespoke bar will be the heart of the restaurant, and the next step is to tile the front and sides, and add rattan detailing on the back wall to truly create the 'wow' factor. </p>",
            "text_size": 2,
            "button_text": "",
            "button_url": "",
            "button_type": "btn--primary",
            "button_size": "",
            "button_style": "btn--solid",
            "show_arrow": false
          }
        },
        "image_ewfgcG": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2025-08-16_at_18.01.04.png",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "Illuminated Signage Prep",
            "heading_size": 3,
            "text": "<p>A large 'Maza at Eighty Six' illuminated sign will adorn this back wall, to be tiled with a range of rich jewel-toned tiles from Parkside Architectural Tiles. We're working closely with Stylo Graphics to produce the internal and external signage, which has been templated and positioned with feeds ready for illumination!</p>",
            "text_size": 2,
            "button_text": "",
            "button_url": "",
            "button_type": "btn--primary",
            "button_size": "",
            "button_style": "btn--solid",
            "show_arrow": false
          }
        }
      },
