    "section_rich_text_6fbNzN": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_xT3htA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>2. <strong>Celebrating Shreya’s 1 Year at Simran Design Ltd</strong></h4>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 20
          }
        },
        "text_TTRkwU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This August marked a special milestone - <strong>Shreya’s one-year anniversary</strong> with Simran Design. Over the past year, Shreya and I have collaborated on nine projects across cafés, restaurants, offices, theatres, podcast rooms, and more. Her creativity, eye for detail, and commitment have helped shape the evolution of our studio. We’re already looking forward to project number ten and many more busy, creative days together!</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
