    "section_rich_text_7XbMG6": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_iFjgpq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>3. <strong>3D Visualisations Completed </strong></h4>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 20
          }
        },
        "text_TbRMpQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We’ve recently completed the <strong>3D design stage for Nautilus Designs</strong>, a workplace project in Wolverhampton. This office redesign included a reception, hallway, company history wall, showroom for office furniture products, and a boardroom.</p><p>Our approach was all about incorporating <strong>brand guidelines, colour palettes, and practical flow requirements</strong> into each area while minimising disruption to the client’s existing layouts. By focusing on the user experience and the client’s wholesale product showcase, we’ve created a scheme that is both functional and brand-aligned.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
