            "title": "4. Supplier Visit: Coach House, Accrington",
            "heading_size": 7,
            "text": "<p>We had the pleasure of visiting <strong>Coach House</strong>, one of our key UK suppliers and one of the largest trade-only interiors suppliers in the country. Based in Accrington, their showroom is a designer’s dream - filled with curated spaces and new season collections.</p><p>We specified accessories for Maza during our visit and explored their styled sets, many of which featured products we first saw at this year’s Spring Fair. It’s invaluable to work with suppliers who understand design trends and help us source pieces that complete our hospitality and workplace interiors.</p>",
            "text_size": 4,
